// main.py's embedding arms: fireworks_ai resolves its key here, together_ai and nvidia_nim stay in B044's OpenAI branch, and perplexity is B5834's; the skip keeps the exhaustive no-op arm within clippy's 40-line limit
#[rustfmt::skip]
#[must_use]
